---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="sbp10dcabuyschart">
  <div class="sbp10dcabuyschart-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 288" role="img" aria-label="Line chart of the VN-Index month-end close from January 2022 to December 2023 with a dot for each monthly buy and a dashed line at the average cost of 1,164.86.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>24 monthly buys of 5,000,000 VND on the VN-Index, Jan 2022 to Dec 2023</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>24 lần mua 5.000.000 đồng vào VN-Index, 1/2022 đến 12/2023</tspan></text>
      <line x1="80" y1="235.0" x2="730" y2="235.0" class="ln" />
      <text x="72" y="239.0" class="m" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>1,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1.000</tspan></text>
      <line x1="80" y1="175.0" x2="730" y2="175.0" class="ln" />
      <text x="72" y="179.0" class="m" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>1,200</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1.200</tspan></text>
      <line x1="80" y1="115.0" x2="730" y2="115.0" class="ln" />
      <text x="72" y="119.0" class="m" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>1,400</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1.400</tspan></text>
      <polyline points="80.0,91.3 108.3,88.0 136.5,87.4 164.8,125.0 193.0,147.2 221.3,175.7 249.6,173.1 277.8,150.8 306.1,195.4 334.3,226.6 362.6,220.5 390.9,232.9 419.1,201.6 447.4,227.6 475.7,215.6 503.9,220.3 532.2,212.4 560.4,198.9 588.7,168.1 617.0,167.8 645.2,188.8 673.5,226.5 701.7,206.8 730.0,196.0" class="path-line" />
      <circle cx="80.0" cy="91.3" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="108.3" cy="88.0" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="136.5" cy="87.4" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="164.8" cy="125.0" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="193.0" cy="147.2" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="221.3" cy="175.7" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="249.6" cy="173.1" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="277.8" cy="150.8" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="306.1" cy="195.4" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="334.3" cy="226.6" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="362.6" cy="220.5" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="390.9" cy="232.9" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="419.1" cy="201.6" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="447.4" cy="227.6" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="475.7" cy="215.6" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="503.9" cy="220.3" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="532.2" cy="212.4" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="560.4" cy="198.9" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="588.7" cy="168.1" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="617.0" cy="167.8" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="645.2" cy="188.8" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="673.5" cy="226.5" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="701.7" cy="206.8" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <circle cx="730.0" cy="196.0" r="3.6" class="dot" />
      <line x1="80" y1="185.54131386021558" x2="730" y2="185.54131386021558" class="dash" />
      <text x="740" y="180" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Average cost</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giá vốn bình quân</tspan></text>
      <text x="740" y="196" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>1,164.86</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1.164,86</tspan></text>
      <text x="88.0" y="81.31199999999998" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>First buy 1,478.96</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lần mua đầu 1.478,96</tspan></text>
      <text x="740" y="218" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Last close</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đóng cửa cuối</tspan></text>
      <text x="740" y="234" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>1,129.93</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1.129,93</tspan></text>
      <text x="80.0" y="272" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>2022-01</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2022-01</tspan></text>
      <text x="221.3" y="272" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>2022-06</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2022-06</tspan></text>
      <text x="390.9" y="272" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>2022-12</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2022-12</tspan></text>
      <text x="560.4" y="272" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>2023-06</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2023-06</tspan></text>
      <text x="730.0" y="272" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>2023-12</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2023-12</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Month-end closes from SSI iBoard. Low months buy more index points per dong, so the average cost ends below the last close.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giá đóng cửa cuối tháng từ SSI iBoard. Tháng giá thấp mua được nhiều điểm hơn trên mỗi đồng, nên giá vốn bình quân thấp hơn giá cuối kỳ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
   .sbp10dcabuyschart { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp10dcabuyschart-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .green { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .gold { fill: var(--act-1); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .card-gold { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .ln { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .axis { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .dash { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .arw { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .arw-h { fill: var(--text-muted); }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .bar-red { fill: var(--red); }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .bar-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .bar-gold { fill: var(--gold); }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .bar-mut { fill: var(--text-faint); }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .path-line { fill: none; stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .path-red { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .dot { fill: var(--act-2); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart .dot-red { fill: var(--red); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10dcabuyschart figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
